@format 1
@id audio.change-persistence
@title Change audio persistent setting
@area Audio
@entry input
@summary Change a processing-step or Skip Persistent setting and propagate the carried portion of the current Audio plan to listed sources.
@flow TB
@related audio.restore-plan, audio.save-plan

@alias inspector = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAudioTab
@alias audio = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LAudio

[input] Persistent setting changes <input>
- Publish a prepared processing-step or Skip persistent-setting change @ inspector.PInspectorPersistentPrepare(...)
> guard

[guard] Check whether a persistent plan exists <decision>
- Suppress propagation while plans are restoring or no persistent step is selected @ tab.PAudioPersistentWrite(...)
? "No persistent plan is selected" > unchanged
? "A persistent plan is available" > propagate

[propagate] Save carried plan for listed sources <storage>
- Read the selected persistent processing steps and Skip state @ inspector.PInspectorPersistentRead(...)
- Read and merge each source's existing audio plan @ audio.LAudioPlanRead(...)
@ audio.LAudioPlanResolve(...)
- Save the merged plan for every listed source @ audio.LAudioPlanSave(...)
> result

[result] Persistent audio state propagated <output>
= Each listed source receives the selected persistent parts of the current Audio plan.

[unchanged] Propagation suppressed <output>
= Existing source plans remain unchanged.
